    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know about the hotlines. i've done the whole thing. but they don't get it. it's not about being \"unwell,\" it's about the fact that the house is already empty. there's nothing left to save. when the lights go out, the house is just... stillness. it's cleaner than staying in the dimness, you know?",
